Rustleys WhatsApp is an independent Rust port of WhiskeySockets/Baileys.
Upstream: https://github.com/WhiskeySockets/Baileys
Pinned baseline: bb0a87e0326ca8f882fe716c7ee42da362f73fc0
Original MIT license and copyright are retained in LICENSE.
No affiliation with WhatsApp/Meta or endorsement by WhiskeySockets is implied.

proto/WAProto.proto is copied verbatim from the pinned Baileys baseline.
The build generates a separate protoc-compatible schema by normalizing 23 enums
(non-zero-first enums rejected by protoc but accepted by protobuf.js). Existing
field numbers and enum numeric values are preserved and verified in tests.
RustCrypto, x25519-dalek, prost and other Rust dependencies retain their own
licenses, recorded by their distributions. Node, libsignal and the WASM bridge
are development-only reference oracles and are not the Rust runtime.
